  "title": "Lab Order Tracking Log",
  "subtitle": "Capture authenticated order, test code, specimen, and collection window; confirm result route and cancellation.",
  "description": "Lab Order records authenticated order, test code, specimen, collection window, result route, and cancellation. Lab Order evidence stays linked.",
  "use_case": "Use this lab order time-ordered tracking when staff must document authenticated order and test code. Reconcile specimen, collection window, result route, and cancellation before the lab order handoff. Use the authenticated requisition, ordered test list, diagnosis or reason source as allowed, specimen requirement, collection window, laboratory destination, and cancellation log. Ask the assigned lab order reviewer to confirm authenticated order against the organization's policy.",
  "risk_tier": "C",
